The dealer checks behind. At showdown the dealer shows Q♠ 6♥, a queen-high hand. Your A♥ K♦ plays ace-high with A K 9 7 4 from the board, which beats it. You win the 120 pot, a net gain of 60 chips, and your bankroll is now 1,060.

